Week 2  Provider-Agnostic LLM Client

about the project
In this practical, I developed a provider-agnostic LLM client that supports multiple AI providers, including Google Gemini and Ollama.

Work Completed
- Implemented a common interface for interacting with different LLM providers.
- Integrated Gemini and Ollama.
- Configured provider selection and response generation.
- Created unit tests to verify the client functionality.

Technologies Used
Python, Google Gemini API, Ollama, Requests, Python-dotenv, Pytest.

Execution
python main.py

Testing
python -m pytest -v


Output
The unit test executed successfully with the result:



Gemini response generation was tested successfully. Ollama integration was also configured, although local inference was limited by available system memory.

Learning 
I learned how to build a common interface for multiple LLM providers and test their integration.
